["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why the Agent Era Needs a New Operating System | DHH Omachi Omicron Foundation vibe code pseudo-anonymous hacker\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-a16z-dhh说源代码护城河已经没了-谁还信就是在自欺欺人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>DHH說源代碼護城河已經沒了：誰還信就是在自欺欺人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DHH認為Agent讓軟件開發成本歸零，Mac和Windows的鼠標點擊式交互天生不適合Agent，而Linux歷史上被嫌棄的終端、配置文件、詳細報錯，恰好是Agent最愛的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Linux</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"368: Gut Bacteria and Vaccine Induced Fever MALDI-TOF calprotectin flagellin DOT-MGA essential agreement (EA)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-thisweekinmicr-疫苗接种后发烧-根源可能是你肠道里的一种细菌和加工食品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eb4df99c03bbbeed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Microbiology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>疫苗接種後發燒，根源可能是你腸道里的一種細菌和加工食品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究發現愛吃西式加工食品的人腸道里鞭毛菌 Waltera 更多，鞭毛蛋白引發慢性腸道炎症，這讓他們打疫苗後更容易發燒——糞便移植到無菌小鼠身上也能復現這個效應。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">腸道微生物組</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗反應原性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen’s Not Coming Back, Adventures in Agentic Commerce, Q&amp;A on United, GTA VI, iPhone Duo SKU EUV\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-sharptech-黄仁勋的真正罪名不是芯片流入中国-而是公开反对芯片禁令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳的真正罪名不是芯片流入中國，而是公開反對芯片禁令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達賣給Megaspeed供阿里巴巴用的芯片生意本來完全合法，真正讓黃仁勳出局的，是他在芯片禁令問題上和政府對著幹、拒絕像銀行一樣配合執法。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片禁令</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Your Kid Doesn’t Need a “Thing” Yet. The Science of Late Specialization kind learning environment / wicked learning environment match quality paramecium principle\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-raisinggh-顶尖运动员小时候很少是最强的-早专项反而是负向指标/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c2fa69281802c1bc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">39:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>頂尖運動員小時候很少是最強的，早專項反而是負向指標</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一項針對近3萬名音樂家、科學家、運動員的研究發現，童年最優秀的人幾乎從不是成年後最優秀的人，早專項、早排名反而預示著更差的成年表現和更高的受傷率。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">青少年體育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is the Iran War good for the planet? Strait of Hormuz Strategic Petroleum Reserve petrostates vs electrostates permitting reform\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-grayarea-伊朗战争切断霍尔木兹两成石油-油价却没涨到200美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ebbc73f24465a9d8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>伊朗戰爭切斷霍爾木茲兩成石油，油價卻沒漲到200美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這場史上最大石油供應中斷本該把油價推到200美元，結果靠中國囤貨、沙特繞道管線和各國戰略儲備硬扛了過去，而真正傷到全球經濟的是柴油，不是汽油。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">能源政策</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How an American AI Company Uses Chinese Open-Weight Models open weight obliterated model RL environment\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-oddlots-美国ai创业公司私下都在用中国开源模型-只是不敢公开说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">48:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>美國AI創業公司私下都在用中國開源模型，只是不敢公開說</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正的護城河不是選哪個基礎模型，而是能不能用自己的數據把開源權重微調成比巨頭單次調用更便宜、更準的專用模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">模型微調</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vasa: History&#x27;s Least Successful Warship broadside psychological safety\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-cautionary-瓦萨号沉没真相-不是国王瞎指挥-是没人敢说真话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">36:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>瓦薩號沉沒真相：不是國王瞎指揮，是沒人敢說真話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">瓦薩號首航十分鐘內傾覆，流傳百年的「國王瞎改設計」說法是神話，真正致命的是副將弗萊明明知船不安全，卻因為怕得罪國王而對這個致命問題保持沉默。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理安全感</span><span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Joe Studwell on How Africa Works, and What It Tells Us About China developmental state performance legitimacy AGOA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-sinicapodcast-人口密度-不是腐败或民族冲突-才是非洲发展的天花板/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bca247db164ef0a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Sinica Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>人口密度，不是腐敗或民族衝突，才是非洲發展的天花板</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者放棄了腐敗、民族衝突這類主流解釋，論證說非洲獨立時人口密度不到每平方公里十人，這才是城市化、財政和基建長期起不來的根源，東亞模式的政策本身反而是通用的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">非洲發展</span><span class=\"tag\">東亞模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Scaling Linear’s GTM to $100M ARR — Cristina Cordova, COO MCP SDR AE Forward Deployed Engineer Loops\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-latentspace-linear-coo自曝-企业级销售靠砍掉原定路线图-全力押注agent才追上来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4bdc663aa3f33e23-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>Linear COO自曝：企業級銷售靠砍掉原定路線圖，全力押注agent才追上來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Linear在2025年臨時放棄原定的企業級功能路線圖，轉去全力建MCP服務器和agent平臺，結果反而靠這個贏得了原計劃拿不到的大客戶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">GTM</span><span class=\"tag\">企業銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Should TSMC Make 3D DRAM? High-Aspect Ratio etching oxide semiconductor（IGZO等） Back End of the Line / Front End of the Line gain cell FeFET\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-asianometry-tsmc-真要造-3d-dram-nvidia-开口-历史包袱还在/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/71aac68272b8f78a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">17:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>TSMC 真要造 3D DRAM？Nvidia 開口，歷史包袱還在</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TSMC 曾兩次嘗試為客戶代工 DRAM 都以失敗收場，如今 Nvidia 的請求讓它重新面對這個二十年沒碰過的生意，但這次說的不是傳統 DRAM，而是基於氧化物半導體的全新堆疊存儲。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體</span><span class=\"tag\">TSMC</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The making of Anthropic public benefit corporation Glasswing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-anthropic-anthropic-曾落后到不行-三年前客户问凭什么选你们/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1133dbc5dfc7944-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">15:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Anthropic</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic 曾落後到不行：三年前客戶問憑什麼選你們</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic 創立後一度完全落後於前沿模型，靠死磕預訓練和RL熬過「受苦的幾年」才追上來，而這段差距期反而讓安全研究更紮實。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span><span class=\"tag\">公司歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Julian Gewirtz on the AI risks that actually scare Beijing loss of control anquan AGI-pilled Mythos\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-eightythousand-北京最怕的ai风险不是ai失控-而是政权失去控制/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c851b271273144ee-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>北京最怕的AI風險不是AI失控，而是政權失去控制</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國官方說的「失控」首先指政治控制的喪失，而非對齊失控；比起AI安全論文，美國展現出的網絡攻擊能力(Mythos事件)才是過去一年裡真正讓北京緊張起來的事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美關係</span><span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Fast Should We Build Superintelligence? | Nick Bostrom pacing the frontier situationally aware Gini coefficient\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-a16z-延迟一天都不该多等-博斯特罗姆算了超级智能的最优时点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">39:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>延遲一天都不該多等：博斯特羅姆算了超級智能的最優時點</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">博斯特羅姆用人命換算延遲成本：每天約15萬人死於自然原因，所以除非安全研究能讓風險快速下降，否則最優延遲只是幾個月到幾年，而不是幾十年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">超級智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Abhinav Ghosh on the role of NGO workers in Education Policy and Delivery in India FLN (Foundational Literacy and Numeracy) MOU implicit bureaucrats\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-ideasofindia-印度ngo员工坐在政府办公室里-靠-上面的命令-指挥官员却无正式身份/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/79bdc8c7009c7460-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ideas of India</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>印度NGO員工坐在政府辦公室裡，靠「上面的命令」指揮官員卻無正式身份</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這些NGO基層員工不是公務員，卻能借政府文件上的logo、共用的辦公桌座位等暗示性符號獲得官員服從；面對教師時，同一人立刻換成說服而非命令的姿態。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育政策</span><span class=\"tag\">NGO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Superintelligence Needs the Physical World with CEO and Co-Founder of Arda Bob McGrew hard takeoff forward deployed engineering (FDE) Von Neumann probe Drake equation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-nopriors-超级智能困在数据中心里-离开它才算真的开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/37c17736c18ba5a1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">59:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>超級智能困在數據中心裡，離開它才算真的開始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Arda創始人Bob McGrew認為自動化研究員只是一次性加速而非遞歸自我改進，真正的瓶頸是物理世界：實驗要在溼實驗室跑，機器人要在工廠裝配，智能必須走出數據中心才能變成生產力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">製造業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Does Every Canadian Need a Financial Planner? | #436 credence good Dunning-Kruger curve fee-only / advice-only\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-rationalreminder-只有5-加拿大人找理财规划师-44-不懂规划到底是什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>只有5%加拿大人找理財規劃師，44%不懂規劃到底是什麼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大多數人把買基金等同於理財規劃，但退休提取、遺產安排、稅務協調才是規劃的大頭，卻是普及率最低的部分。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">財富管理</span><span class=\"tag\">行業結構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Hard Is It to Get Off Antidepressants? SSRI SNRI brain zaps tapering\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-sciencevs-停抗抑郁药的真实风险-吃了两年以上-戒断率可能超四分之一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d090f82d7f4dd2d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">47:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>停抗抑鬱藥的真實風險：吃了兩年以上，戒斷率可能超四分之一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">官方指南和大型臨床試驗說停藥只有3%的人會有嚴重症狀，但那些試驗只測了吃藥八到十二週的人；一項針對長期服用者的調查發現，吃藥兩年以上者有四分之一報告了嚴重戒斷症狀。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">抗抑鬱藥</span><span class=\"tag\">精神健康</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"This Is The Problem With AI&#x27;s Most Bullish Chart ground truth tight gradient descent LTV (Loan-to-Value) TAM fractional reserve banking\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-oddlots-gpu租金指数一路走高-这可能是缺钱的信号-不是缺芯片的信号/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>GPU租金指數一路走高：這可能是缺錢的信號，不是缺芯片的信號</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GPU出租價格上漲常被當作AI需求旺盛的鐵證，但這期揭示它更可能反映的是中小云廠商借不到低息貸款、被迫靠更高客戶預付款硬撐的融資緊張。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">GPU融資</span><span class=\"tag\">信貸市場</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Edward Said and the question of Palestine Orientalism Oslo Accord West-Eastern Divan Orchestra\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-throughline-萨义德把巴勒斯坦问题带进美国主流话语-却从未等到他期望的和解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4024x4024+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F02%2F04%2F30b53e8145b4a73e61d296056ad9%2F1c50c67c-46c2-421d-91f3-a194d2396347.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>薩義德把巴勒斯坦問題帶進美國主流話語，卻從未等到他期望的和解</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">薩義德一生試圖用文學與音樂的語言讓西方理解巴勒斯坦人的存在，但他晚年親眼看到奧斯陸協議簽署後殺戮反而更多，並斷定兩國方案已被現實架空。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">巴以衝突</span><span class=\"tag\">後殖民理論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Juba II: Rome’s King of Africa client king Euphorbia\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-ancients-凯撒把战败敌人的幼子养大-养成了北非最亲罗马的国王/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/118420a97bcb462e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>凱撒把戰敗敵人的幼子養大，養成了北非最親羅馬的國王</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱巴二世兩歲時作為戰俘被凱撒牽著遊街，卻被收養進屋大維婭家中長大，最終被奧古斯都扶上毛里塔尼亞王位，統治四十年從未被羅馬懷疑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬帝國</span><span class=\"tag\">北非歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Hatshepsut: Was This Really Egypt&#x27;s Greatest Pharaoh? regent Opet Festival co-regency\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-historyhit-哈特谢普苏特不是女扮男装-她把自己做成了法老/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6426b5c63fd6a864-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>哈特謝普蘇特不是女扮男裝，她把自己做成了法老</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她不是偽裝成男人的女王，而是把王權本身的圖像語言——那副假鬍鬚——改寫成「國王」的標誌，用貿易和建築而非戰爭定義了何為偉大的統治者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古埃及</span><span class=\"tag\">法老</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"724. The Charge of the Light Brigade: Into The Valley of Death (Part 4) redoubt the thin red line Causeway Heights\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-restishistory-轻骑兵冲锋并非愚蠢送死-战术上它其实成功了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/77709224d0619622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>輕騎兵衝鋒並非愚蠢送死：戰術上它其實成功了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">命令含糊、將領失和導致六百輕騎兵衝向三面炮火的死亡谷，但他們真的打垮了俄軍炮兵和騎兵，是戰略上的災難，戰術上的勝利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">克里米亞戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">軍事史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"415. Lawrence of Arabia: Rory Stewart vs. William Dalrymple - The Legacy (Part 5) Seven Pillars of Wisdom Sykes-Picot McMahon letters India Office Arab Bulletin\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-empirehist-劳伦斯写信痛斥英国在伊拉克撒谎-结果被昔日同僚联手抹黑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">49:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>勞倫斯寫信痛斥英國在伊拉克撒謊，結果被昔日同僚聯手抹黑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他對伊拉克佔領的憤怒預言了百年後的戰爭現實，但正是這些批評招來印度事務處和外交部的全力抹黑，說他不懂阿拉伯語、沒資格說話。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東史</span><span class=\"tag\">殖民主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"189: Geodesic顧全全：預訓練有點“無聊”了，但用scaling改變AI製藥才剛開始 訓飛 Try2 Scaling Law\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-latetalk-预训练的新意正在变少-但把scaling搬进ai制药才刚开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac7d832522d328e5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>預訓練的新意正在變少，但把Scaling搬進AI製藥才剛開始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">字節的蛋白質結構設計模型只用2650萬個結構數據就訓出900兆參數模型，而公開結構數據有13億個——算力而不是數據，才是AI製藥現在最大的瓶頸。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI製藥</span><span class=\"tag\">Scaling</span>\n</div></div></a>"]